# {{lb|en|transitive}} To make free; set at [[liberty]]; [[release]].
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Tempest|I|ii|page=5|passage={{w|Prospero|''Pro.''}}{{...}}{{w|Ariel (The Tempest)|Spirit}}, fine ſpirit, [[I'll|Ile]] '''free''' thee / Within two dayes for this.}}
